##### Avoid JSON.stringify in Hot Paths
```typescript
// BAD: Stringify for comparison
if (JSON.stringify(a) === JSON.stringify(b)) { ... }

// GOOD: Deep equality check
import { isEqual } from 'lodash-es'
if (isEqual(a, b)) { ... }
